        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_32d07ba2a857479fa1217d7b96ce86ce",
      "statement": "Forward kinematics refuses a pose whose position or rotation count disagrees with the skeleton's bone count by throwing with both counts named, rather than asserting, because the mismatch would otherwise surface as an IndexOutOfRangeException from inside NativeSlice with nothing identifying the two things that disagreed.",
